                        "form": "eggcrates"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "325ced5d-533b-3f72-b4a8-b171ec5def0f",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg crate.",
                            "A crate for eggs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "56592c3a-e26d-4442-8e57-fc16f084a903",
                                "sense_id": "325ced5d-533b-3f72-b4a8-b171ec5def0f",
                                "text": "The eggcrate fused silica lightweight mirror structure is assembled from machined fused silica parts and consists usually Of two circular plates between which is fitted a core Structure of slotted, interlocking ribs (similar to the dividers in old fashioned eggcrates)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c371cbe-d4d2-3e36-b10d-6a73414f1245",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg crate.",
                            "A self-contained class"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "59ccbbff-9726-436e-a151-8b793666bd94",
                                "sense_id": "5c371cbe-d4d2-3e36-b10d-6a73414f1245",
                                "text": "Instead of having a nice modular eggcrate, we now want to build an immodular eggcrate. Deliberately we want to impose upon future teachers, not the nice simple eggcrate, but a more complicated one."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a5af12aa-703a-3c11-99a8-c93760c5cb35",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg crate.",
                            "A foam pad"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97adefbb-59a3-4890-9ddc-bfc6e82232e7",
                                "sense_id": "a5af12aa-703a-3c11-99a8-c93760c5cb35",
                                "text": "Mean Skin Assessment Scale scores of patients in control, hydrocolloid dressing and eggcrate foam groups Group Mean score in treatment period"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11dc408b-cfd4-3e3e-a162-a2569a67d006",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg crate.",
                            "A textured surface or insert."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5817a39f-e893-4eb8-be34-0906697cb932",
                                "sense_id": "11dc408b-cfd4-3e3e-a162-a2569a67d006",
                                "text": "Although eggcrate louvers can effectively cut off the view of bright lamps, the grid itself can become rather bright, especially when it is white."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21e79c6d-2aa1-4d52-83a5-9170d84b8563",
                                "sense_id": "11dc408b-cfd4-3e3e-a162-a2569a67d006",
                                "text": "The eggcrate is recessed in a suspended plaster ceiling and extends almost the full length of the 70 foot long store, giving the illusion of a floating ceiling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08754dd9-7be1-4bc5-b264-99890104fd51",
                                "sense_id": "11dc408b-cfd4-3e3e-a162-a2569a67d006",
                                "text": "The eggcrate fused silica lightweight mirror structure is assembled from machined fused silica parts and consists usually Of two circular plates between which is fitted a core Structure of slotted, interlocking ribs (similar to the dividers in old fashioned eggcrates)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "579cdb3f-ee73-380e-8120-276677be03e5",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg crate.",
                            "A style of roof"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6244732-7d00-4e44-ba96-5039eb8f1e06",
                                "sense_id": "579cdb3f-ee73-380e-8120-276677be03e5",
                                "text": "An eggcrate shelter, which is open to the sky but substantial enough to give the feeling of protection, may be your answer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0af90e34-767f-4fee-b062-835acf8fb22d",
                                "sense_id": "579cdb3f-ee73-380e-8120-276677be03e5",
                                "text": "One very popular type of overhead shelter is the eggcrate. The eggcrate is composed of horizontal roof supports at right angles to one another, with equal spacing in both directions."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39632892-7985-3266-9b36-307b7b83e7c7",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg crate.",
                            "Grid-like support structure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7119341a-3de6-4809-b8f3-72cdfca53321",
                                "sense_id": "39632892-7985-3266-9b36-307b7b83e7c7",
                                "text": "Eggcrates are carefully aligned at specific locations by adjusting the location of each radially with corresponding tube holes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "008a8a84-9eed-435b-a77e-6ba94e2eb220",
                                "sense_id": "39632892-7985-3266-9b36-307b7b83e7c7",
                                "text": "To prevent distortion during the postcure, the eggcrate support structure is usually attached to the faceplate prior to postcure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "110a1e37-93f6-4ff0-afeb-1d88f94f7900",
                                "sense_id": "39632892-7985-3266-9b36-307b7b83e7c7",
                                "text": "There was no fuel cladding, no zirconium egg-crates holding the fuel in a rigid matrix, no steam in the reactor vessel to float away with fission products into the atmosphere, and, of course, there was no danger of the fuel melting."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2767d34-257d-3927-bf98-7d3e28007a7c",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of egg-crating (plastic mat)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad587c02-acac-400d-98be-10a138e935e6",
                                "sense_id": "e2767d34-257d-3927-bf98-7d3e28007a7c",
                                "text": "Many hobbyists are familiar with the material known as \"eggcrate.\" For those who don't know, eggcrate is made of plastic strips forming a grid of squares about 1/2\" wide; it is available in most hardware stores in 2' x 4' sheets and usually costs less than $10."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbe6cf32-aa0f-3e85-a277-3f93336bc77c",
                        "entry_id": "79b38ec9-08b9-3db0-bba6-29ff97040b6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A display that egg-crates multiple images."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c0f59f4-b53e-493a-8bed-284d6d6e74d7",
                                "sense_id": "cbe6cf32-aa0f-3e85-a277-3f93336bc77c",
                                "text": "The eggcrate display has been used on more game shows than any other score display in history, and is still used today on The Price Is Right."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
